# OPERATOR STATE. `make pi-ship` does not overwrite the copy on the Pi
# (PI_OWNED in the Makefile). git holds only the seed for a fresh
# install. Edit it on the Pi, then `sudo pf apply`.
#
# The NTP and NTS servers that a plain segment with NTP=pass can reach
# (segments.d, docs/user_guide/pi_setup.md step 8). Public IPv4 addresses,
# or ranges of /24 or narrower. For such a segment, NTP (UDP 123 and 4123)
# and NTS key exchange (TCP 4460) to these addresses go out. NTP to each
# other address goes to the gateway. A segment without NTP=pass does not
# use this list.
#
# Addresses change. When a device on an NTP=pass segment cannot sync, the
# address of its server is possibly missing here. Find it with
# `dig +short A <server>`, add it, and apply.
#
# Each block below is the A records of the names, resolved 2026-10-28.
# One /32 per address: no operator prefix is confirmed for these servers.

# Cloudflare: time.cloudflare.com (NTP and NTS)
